{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "fitscale-backend-api-v2",
    "name": "Fitscale Backend API",
    "description": "API collection for the Fitscale backend.\n\n## Auth\n- Uses httpOnly cookies (`accessToken`, `refreshToken`). Log in first; Postman sends cookies automatically for the same host.\n- Tokens are **not** returned in the JSON body.\n- `POST /api/auth/register` is currently disabled in code — create users via `POST /api/users`.\n\n## Protected routes\n- `/api/workouts`, `/api/total-workouts`, `/api/badges`, `/api/notifications` — require `accessToken` cookie (mounted with `authMiddleware`).\n- `/api/users` — `POST /` is public; other routes need auth (+ role checks).\n\n## Roles\n- `ADMIN` — list/delete all users; `GET /api/total-workouts/all`\n- Owner or `ADMIN` — get/update/delete user by `:id`\n\n## Enums\n- WorkoutType: PUSHUP | SQUAT | SITUP | PLANK\n- BadgeType: BRONZE_/SILVER_/GOLD_ + PUSHUP|SQUAT|SITUP|PLANK\n- NotificationType: INFO | SUCCESS | WARNING | BADGE | LEADERBOARD\n- UserRoles: ADMIN | TRAINER | USER\n\n## Base URL\n- Default `{{baseUrl}}` is `http://localhost:5001`. Change if your `PORT` differs.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "workoutId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "totalWorkoutId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "badgeId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Health check.\n\n**Response 200:** `{ success: true, message: \"Backend running\" }`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Public auth routes. Login / refresh set httpOnly cookies.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.user?.id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.user.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "    pm.test('accessToken cookie set', () => pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('accessToken')).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "    pm.test('refreshToken cookie set', () => pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('refreshToken')).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Logs in a user.\n\n**Body:** `{ email, password }`\n\n**Sets cookies:** `accessToken`, `refreshToken`\n\n**Response 200:** `{ user, success, message }`\n\n**Response 401:** invalid credentials"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.test('accessToken cookie refreshed', () => pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('accessToken')).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "    pm.test('refreshToken cookie refreshed', () => pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('refreshToken')).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh-token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh-token"]
            },
            "description": "Issues new tokens from the `refreshToken` cookie. No body.\n\n**Response 200:** `{ user, success, message }`\n\n**Response 401:** missing/invalid refresh token"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.test('cookies cleared', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('accessToken')).to.be.undefined;",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('refreshToken')).to.be.undefined;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Logs out. Clears cookies and invalidates refresh token.\n\n**Response 200:** `{ success, message }`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
